* Current-mirror TIA with NMOS source-follower active inductor - reconstruction
* LTspice: File > Open (All files) > this .net > Run.  Keep ptm90.lib in this folder.
* One analysis at a time: un-comment the one you want with ";" removed.
.include ptm90.lib
.temp 35

Vdd vdd 0 dc 1
Cpd in 0 450f
CL out 0 50f
Iin 0 in dc 0 ac 1
Ibp vbp 0 dc 20u
Mdp vbp vbp vdd vdd pmos90 W=2u L=200n AD=0.4p AS=0.4p PD=4.4u PS=4.4u
Cbp vbp vdd 2p
Mp1 in vbp vdd vdd pmos90 W=37.58u L=200n AD=7.516p AS=7.516p PD=75.56u PS=75.56u
M1 in in 0 0 nmos90 W=7.45u L=100n AD=1.49p AS=1.49p PD=15.3u PS=15.3u
M2 out in 0 0 nmos90 W=23.22u L=100n AD=4.643p AS=4.643p PD=46.83u PS=46.83u
Rf out in 8.4054k
Ma vdd ga out 0 nmos90 W=2.032u L=100n AD=0.4064p AS=0.4064p PD=4.464u PS=4.464u
Rg vdd ga 53.21k

.ac dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.noise V(out) Iin dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.op
;.tran 0 6.667e-08 6.667e-09 6.667e-12   ; eye: replace Iin by the PRBS source below
;Ipr 0 in PWL file=prbs7_3G.txt   ; 20 uA pk-pk NRZ PRBS7 (prbs7_*.txt is in this folder)
.meas AC zt0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 10Meg
.meas AC zpk MAX mag(V(out))
.meas AC f3db WHEN mag(V(out))=zt0/sqrt(2) FALL=1
.backanno
.end
